# Mobile (Expo) configuration. Copy to .env (ignored by Git) and restart `npx expo start`.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are bundled into the app and visible to anyone with it:
# put ONLY the backend origin here. Never put OPENAI_API_KEY or the demo token here.
# Must be an origin the phone can reach (not localhost), e.g. https://your-tunnel.example
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
